&lt;p&gt;However the current fix is not enough for all possible custom arrays. More effort is needed to provide the general fix. Opened the ticket for this &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3244&quot; title=&quot;Custom arrays are not serialized properly by CacheObjectBinaryProcessorImpl&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-3244&quot;&gt;IGNITE-3244&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
